+.. conf::
+   :keys: dependency_groups
+   :default: <empty list>
+   :version_added: 4.22
+
+   Name of the :pep:`735` dependency groups (defined within the ``[dependency-groups]`` table of the ``pyproject.toml``
+   found at :ref:`package_root`) to install into the environment. Installed after :ref:`deps`, but before the package.
+
+   For example:
+    .. tab:: TOML
+
+       .. code-block:: toml
+
+          [tool.tox.env_run_base]
+          dependency_groups = [
+            "test",
+          ]
+
+    .. tab:: INI
+
+       .. code-block:: ini
+
+        [testenv]
+        dependency_groups =
+            test
+
 .. conf::
    :keys: use_develop, usedevelop
    :default: false
